{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10134100","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10134100","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1013410001:1":{"text":"もう辺りも暗くなってる。古い標識は魔像に壊されちまってるから、アタシが先に行って道を探ってくるよ。","source_cn":"夜已经深了，旧日的路标最近被魔偶毁了，我得去探探路，才...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30EB575D94DE2439","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013410002:1":{"text":"さてと……おいアンタら、アタシ一人に行かせるのは不安だろ？","source_cn":"让我看看——喂，你们也不放心让我一个人去探路吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48E9C14EE671B08E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013410003:2":{"text":"特にテミシア。まるでアタシが大勢の強盗を引き連れて戻ってくると思ってるような目だな。","source_cn":"尤其是特弥希娅。你的眼神，好像我正准备着带回一大帮匪徒...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6ACCDA5C8A51323C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013410004:2":{"text":"分かっているだろうが、私はハナからお前に道案内させるつもりはなかった。","source_cn":"你应该记得，让你担任向导与我们同行，这从来不是我的意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4356D99943A72E73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1013410005:1":{"text":"だが<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>殿がお前の同行を許した以上、私にはお前を見張る義務がある。","source_cn":"但现在……既然<style=stress><playe...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x202CEC863A941DC9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"